    "longBusinessSummary": "Yoshimura Food Holdings K.K., through its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells food products in Japan, Singapore, and Malaysia. It operates through Manufacturing Business, Sales Business, and Other Businesses segments. The company offers peanut butter creamy, chocolate creamy, Chinese cuisine ingredients, spring roll wrappers, wine, dried bonito shavings, dashi, soup, nabe sets, sushi, rolls, rice balls, soft furikake, jellies, seaweed, hijiki, mekabu, ramen noodles, gyoza dumpling skins, sauces, scallops, salmon, salmon roe, crab, sweet fish, processed seafood products, chestnuts, Chinese entrées, sake, dry noodles, buckwheat and wheat flour, pork cutlets, and tuna. It also provides frozen food, such as seafood products, fried oysters, fried chicken cartilage, and fried chicken tender cutlets, as well as freeze-dried products. In addition, the company imports, sells, and maintains commercial kitchen equipment; and trades in healthy food. Further, it engages in the operation of hot spring facilities and restaurants; real estate leasing and management; and event, media, and marketing business activities. Yoshimura Food Holdings K.K. was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan.",
